", \"text\": \"A water leak often indicates a clogged drain line or a frozen evaporator coil. Turn off the AC to prevent water damage and call us immediately for a central AC water leak repair.\"}},\r\n                {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the difference between HVAC and central AC?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"HVAC stands for Heating, Ventilation, and Air Conditioning. Central AC is a component of the overall HVAC system responsible for cooling. We are full-service HVAC contractors Vadodara, handling everything from installation to repair.\"}},\r\n                {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can you handle commercial HVAC services?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, we specialize in Commercial HVAC service Vadodara, including office central AC installation and industrial HVAC services for businesses of all sizes.\"}},\r\n                {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How can I find a reliable central AC technician in Vadodara?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Look for companies with certified technicians, positive reviews, transparent pricing, and guarantees on their work. Atlas Aircon is proud to be one of the top HVAC companies in Vadodara meeting all these criteria.\"}},\r\n                {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Why is my central AC not cooling?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A central AC not cooling can be due to several reasons: low refrigerant, dirty filters, a faulty compressor, or thermostat issues. Our technicians can quickly diagnose and fix the problem. Contact us for central AC not cooling repair Vadodara.\"}},\r\n                {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Do you install ductable AC systems?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, we are experts in ductable AC installation Vadodara. These systems are an excellent choice for uniform cooling across larger 