 Check for obstructions. If clear, the motor might need repair. Call for a Central AC maintenance service.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-8\">\r\n<div class=\"relative flex space-x-3\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"text-white font-bold\">F1</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1 pt-1.5 flex justify-between space-x-4\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500\"><span class=\"font-bold\">Error:</span> Outdoor Condenser Coil Sensor Error. <span class=\"font-bold\">Solution:</span> Ensure the outdoor unit is clean. Persistent error needs expert HVAC repair service Vadodara.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"flex justify-center\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"rounded-lg shadow-md\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/modern-digital-thermostat-perhaps-showing-an-error-message-or-incorrect-temperature.webp\" alt=\"AC Error Code Display\" title=\"\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<!-- Pricing List Section -->\r\n<section id=\"pricing\" class=\"py-16 bg-white\">\r\n<div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center mb-12\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-3xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 sm:text-4xl\">Transparent &amp; Affordable Service Pricing</h2>\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 text-xl text-gray-600\">Fair and upfront pricing. Know the Central AC repair charges in Vadodara before we start.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto shadow-xl rounded-lg overflow-hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-sm text-left text-gray-500\">\r\n<thead class=\"text-xs text-gray-700 uppercase bg-gray-100\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<th class=\"px-6 py-3\" scope=\"col\">Service / Part</th>\r\n<th class=\"px-6 py-3\" scope=\"col\">Description</th>\r\n<th class=\"px-6 py-3\" scope=\"col\">Estimated Price (INR)</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"bg-white border-b\">\r\